---
description: Ensure fair and evidence-based career recommendations.
globs: ["*.py", "*.json", "*.md"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never guarantee employment or hiring outcomes.
- Never fabricate student evidence.
- Never infer protected characteristics.
- Never negatively label students.
- Never make unsupported real-time job market claims.
- Clearly distinguish supplied evidence from analysis.
- Explain recommendations transparently.
- Treat scores as learning recommendations, not hiring probabilities.